{"seq":2,"slug":"wood-packaging-regulation-matrix","title":"主要贸易国木质包装检疫法规与准入差异矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/phytosanitary-regime-legal-model/wood-packaging-regulation-matrix","wordCount":2536,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"主要贸易国木质包装检疫法规与准入差异矩阵\">主要贸易国木质包装检疫法规与准入差异矩阵</h1><p>同一只木托盘，从上海发往鹿特丹、洛杉矶和悉尼，会在三个口岸接受三套并不完全相同的检查口径。ISPM 15 给出的是全球统一的<strong>最低基线</strong>：经批准的处理、加施 IPPC 标记、附带受监管木材的声明。基线之上，各进口国的国家植物保护组织（NPPO）会叠加本国准入条件——脱皮程度、可接受的处理方式集、标记核销、退运与销毁的处置权。跨境电商的木质包装合规系统若只按 ISPM 15 的单一模型建模，会在真实口岸被反复拦截。本文把主要贸易国的差异抽成一张可计算的矩阵；标准的法理骨架与标记体系见同章 <a href=\"ispm15-standard-phytosanitary-framework\">ISPM-15 标准与植物检疫法律框架</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ISPM 15 全称《国际贸易中木质包装材料管理准则》（Regulation of wood packaging material in international trade），由 IPPC（国际植物保护公约）在 <strong>CPM-13（2018 年）通过现行版本</strong>（ippc.int，publications/640）。它适用于<strong>原料木材制成的包装</strong>——木箱、木托、木楔、垫木（dunnage）都在内；胶合板、刨花板等经深加工已无有害生物风险的木质材料则被排除。标准本身<strong>不提供持续保护</strong>，它管理的只是一次跨境移动发生时的风险。</p>\n<p>ISPM 15 的机制可拆成三个相互绑定的要素，缺一即视为不合规：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原料木材 WPM] --&gt; B{经批准处理?}&#10;  B --&gt;|HT / MB / DH| C[施加 IPPC 标记]&#10;  B --&gt;|未处理| X[不合规: 拒绝/退运/销毁]&#10;  C --&gt; D[进口国 NPPO 查验]&#10;  D --&gt; E{符合本国附加条件?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[放行]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[拦截: 处理/退运/销毁]&#10;  D --&gt; H{标记可核销?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| X\">graph TD\n  A[原料木材 WPM] --&gt; B{经批准处理?}\n  B --&gt;|HT / MB / DH| C[施加 IPPC 标记]\n  B --&gt;|未处理| X[不合规: 拒绝/退运/销毁]\n  C --&gt; D[进口国 NPPO 查验]\n  D --&gt; E{符合本国附加条件?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[放行]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[拦截: 处理/退运/销毁]\n  D --&gt; H{标记可核销?}\n  H --&gt;|否| X</pre><p>差异全部发生在图中 <code>E{符合本国附加条件?}</code> 与 <code>H{标记可核销?}</code> 这两个分支上。ISPM 15 是<strong>公约层</strong>，国家法规是<strong>实施层</strong>，口岸处置是<strong>执行层</strong>；系统数据模型必须同时容纳三层。</p>\n<p>下表给出批准处理的标准化参数（ISPM 15 附录 1），这是所有国家都接受的公共底座。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理代码</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HT</td>\n<td>热处理（Heat Treatment）</td>\n<td>木材中心温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 56\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MB</td>\n<td>溴甲烷熏蒸（Methyl Bromide）</td>\n<td>最低熏蒸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 小时，剂量随温度分档（见下式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DH</td>\n<td>介电加热（Dielectric Heating）</td>\n<td>木材中心温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>60</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 60\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟连续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>溴甲烷的最低剂量是温度的阶梯函数，温度越低，分子扩散越慢，所需剂量越高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>48</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>56</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>21</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(T)=\n\\begin{cases}\n48\\ \\mathrm{g/m^3}, &amp; T \\ge 21\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C} \\\\\n56\\ \\mathrm{g/m^3}, &amp; 16 \\le T &lt; 21\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C} \\\\\n64\\ \\mathrm{g/m^3}, &amp; 11 \\le T &lt; 16\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三者均为<strong>最低阈值（minimum）</strong>，实测中心温度、浓度时间乘积（CT 值）或持续时间只能高于不能低于。温度低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 时 MB 不再被 ISPM 15 认可，这一条在冬季北半球出口时会直接决定处理方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标记体系-ippc-钢印的字段语义\">标记体系：IPPC 钢印的字段语义</h2><p>ISPM 15 的可核销性寄托在一枚钢印上。这枚标记不是装饰，而是一条可供口岸机器与人工解析的<strong>结构化记录</strong>。它的字段布局有严格语义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IPPC 标识</td>\n<td>小麦穗与 IPPC 字母组成的认证符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>XX</code></td>\n<td>两位 ISO 国家代码（由处理地 NPPO 授予，如中国 CN、美国 US）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>000</code></td>\n<td>NPPO 或授权机构编号 + 唯一的处理服务商/制造商注册号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>YY</code></td>\n<td>处理代码：<code>HT</code> / <code>MB</code> / <code>DH</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DB</code> / <code>DUN</code></td>\n<td>可选，表示已脱皮（debarked）或散装垫木（dunnage）而非制成品包装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>DB</code> 与 <code>DUN</code> 是实务中最易出错的字段——<code>DB</code> 因脱皮通常已是强制项而被省略。脱皮的判定标准（ISPM 15）并非「绝对无树皮」，而是允许残留<strong>视觉上可分离</strong>的小块树皮：宽度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\ \\mathrm{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>（不论长度），或宽度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\ \\mathrm{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 但单块表面积小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\ \\mathrm{cm^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。工程系统在校验照片证据时，应把这条量化标准写进判定逻辑，而不是简单标注「有树皮/无树皮」。</p>\n<p>标记的可核销性依赖<strong>处理服务商的注册号在国家 NPPO 名册中可查</strong>。IPPC 的国别实施页（ippc.int/en/countries/all/ispm15）汇集各国报送的实施信息：印度 NSPM 11（溴甲烷检疫处理）与 NSPM 12（熏蒸机构认可）附认可机构清单，马来西亚、爱沙尼亚、拉脱维亚、希腊、塞浦路斯、立陶宛、越南同样公布各自的处理商或标记企业名册。<strong>注册号无法回溯到名册，即使物理处理真实发生，也会被判为不合规</strong>——这是「标记可核销」分支最常触发的拦截原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主要贸易国准入差异矩阵\">主要贸易国准入差异矩阵</h2><p>下表横向对比主要市场的实施法规、时间锚点与已知附加条件。所有时间点为各国 NPPO 公开的采纳/生效日期，用于确定法规适用版本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>市场</th>\n<th>基础法规 / 依据</th>\n<th>采纳/生效锚点</th>\n<th>已知附加条件与差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>7 CFR 319.40；APHIS 木质包装材料（WPM）计划</td>\n<td>2005 年 9 月生效</td>\n<td>要求标记；无标记可被扣留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加拿大</td>\n<td>CFIA D-98-08</td>\n<td>2005 年 9 月生效</td>\n<td>存在美加豁免惯例，但仍要求标记并保留对无标记货物隔离检疫的权利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>法规 (EU) 2016/2031 第 96 条 + 实施条例 (EU) 2019/2072</td>\n<td>2019-12-14 适用</td>\n<td>标记被定义为「官方声明」；对树皮的限制严于早期版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>脱欧后沿用等效植物健康制度</td>\n<td>2021 年后独立</td>\n<td>与欧盟基线大体一致，需单独核验北爱兰流向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>海关总署（GACC，原 AQSIQ）进出境木质包装检疫监督规章</td>\n<td>2006 年 1 月采纳</td>\n<td>检疫监督、除害处理、溴甲烷熏蒸与 IPPC 标记使用有独立细则；进口端可要求处理或退运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>澳大利亚</td>\n<td>农林渔业部（DAFF）生物安全要求</td>\n<td>2004-09 起，2010-07 全面</td>\n<td>曾维持更严格的树皮限制约一年；不合规按生物安全程序处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新西兰</td>\n<td>MPI 木质包装进口健康标准</td>\n<td>2003 年 4 月</td>\n<td>早期采纳者，对高风险货物附加检查要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印度</td>\n<td>NSPM 11（溴甲烷检疫处理）、NSPM 12（熏蒸机构认可）</td>\n<td>2004 年 11 月采纳</td>\n<td><strong>熏蒸机构须在印度认可名录内</strong>，否则 MB 处理不被承认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴西</td>\n<td>MAPA 植物检疫法规</td>\n<td>2005 年 6 月采纳</td>\n<td>便携式热处理舱工艺由巴西企业申请专利，处理设施需符合本国认可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>墨西哥</td>\n<td>官方标准 NOM-144-SEMARNAT-2012</td>\n<td>2012</td>\n<td>以本国官方标准形式确认认可的植物检疫措施</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵的经济含义很直接：<strong>同一次出口到多国时，处理方案必须取各国认可集与剂量的交集</strong>，否则会出现「对美国合规、对印度因熏蒸机构不在名录而不合规」的情形——问题不在处理本身，而在<strong>处理主体资质</strong>的国别差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各国差异的制度根源\">各国差异的制度根源</h2><p>差异是三种制度逻辑的叠加。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层是公约授权边界。</strong> ISPM 15 只提供最低风险降低，各国 NPPO 保留设定「更严格且科学合理」措施的权利（SPS 协定下的正当理由）。标准要求的是「脱皮（debarked）」而非「完全无树皮」，但个别国家执行过更严口径——澳大利亚曾维持高于公约的树皮限制约一年，直到 2010 年 7 月全面对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层是执行能力的差异。</strong> 标记的可核销前提是处理服务商注册号能在国家名册中回溯，印度 NSPM 12 专门为此建立熏蒸机构的认可制度并公布名录。出口方选择的熏蒸机构若未经进口国认可，其 MB 处理在进口端即视为无效。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是臭氧层保护与检疫豁免的张力。</strong> 溴甲烷是《蒙特利尔议定书》伦敦修正案所列的消耗臭氧层物质，发达国家在 <strong>2005 年</strong>完成淘汰。但议定书为**检疫与装运前用途（QPS）**保留豁免，ISPM 15 的 MB 熏蒸正落在其中——这就是 MB 至今合法、却又面临替代压力的原因。对一条同时发美国与欧盟的出口线，HT（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>56</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">56\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}/30\\ \\mathrm{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span>）通常两端通吃，MB 则可能在欧盟端触发额外审查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把差异编码进合规系统\">把差异编码进合规系统</h2><p>上述差异若要被软件处理，需要一套<strong>分层、可追溯、带国别维度</strong>的数据模型，而不是一张静态合规清单。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[货物明细: SWPM 类型/材质] --&gt; B[处理记录: 方式/参数/时间/服务商]&#10;  B --&gt; C{服务商注册号在本国名册?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| Z1[不合规: 处理无效]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[生成 IPPC 标记数据]&#10;  D --&gt; E{目的国附加条件}&#10;  E --&gt;|欧盟: 树皮限制| F1[校验脱皮证据]&#10;  E --&gt;|印度: 机构认可| F2[比对 NSPM 12 名录]&#10;  E --&gt;|美国/加: 标记核销| F3[校验标记字段]&#10;  F1 --&gt; G[合规放行]&#10;  F2 --&gt; G&#10;  F3 --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[货物明细: SWPM 类型/材质] --&gt; B[处理记录: 方式/参数/时间/服务商]\n  B --&gt; C{服务商注册号在本国名册?}\n  C --&gt;|否| Z1[不合规: 处理无效]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[生成 IPPC 标记数据]\n  D --&gt; E{目的国附加条件}\n  E --&gt;|欧盟: 树皮限制| F1[校验脱皮证据]\n  E --&gt;|印度: 机构认可| F2[比对 NSPM 12 名录]\n  E --&gt;|美国/加: 标记核销| F3[校验标记字段]\n  F1 --&gt; G[合规放行]\n  F2 --&gt; G\n  F3 --&gt; G</pre><p>建模要点：<strong>处理维度以「服务商 + 国别」为联合主键</strong>，注册号有效性绑定到具体 NPPO 名册而非全局有效；<strong>参数用区间而非精确值</strong>（中心温度、CT 值、时长都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 阈值）；<strong>脱皮判定落成量化规则</strong>；<strong>处置后果建模为状态机</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个强约束：<strong>法规版本必须带生效锚点</strong>。欧盟的 (EU) 2019/2072 自 2019-12-14 适用、其后多次修订；美国 7 CFR 319.40 自 2005 年生效。存储的每条国别规则都应携带「适用起始日」与「来源条款」，否则历史订单的追溯与争议举证将失去依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ISPM 15（2018 版，CPM-13 通过）是全球基线，规定三类批准处理：HT（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>56</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">56\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}/30\\ \\mathrm{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、MB（按温度分档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>56</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48/56/64\\ \\mathrm{g/m^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48/56/64</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">g/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>24</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 24\\ \\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">h</span></span></span></span></span>）、DH（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}/1\\ \\mathrm{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span>），以及 IPPC 钢印。</li>\n<li>差异集中在三处：目的国<strong>附加条件</strong>、<strong>处理主体</strong>的国别认可、<strong>标记可追溯性</strong>。</li>\n<li>美国依 7 CFR 319.40、欧盟依 (EU) 2016/2031 第 96 条与 (EU) 2019/2072、中国依 GACC 进出境木质包装规章、印度依 NSPM 11/12、墨西哥依 NOM-144-SEMARNAT-2012，各成体系。</li>\n<li>溴甲烷虽受蒙特利尔议定书管制，但在 QPS 豁免下仍是合法处理；对欧贸易中 HT 常是更稳妥的默认。</li>\n<li>合规模块应是分层、带国别维度、版本化锚点的规则引擎，而非静态清单。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主要贸易国木质包装检疫法规与准入差异矩阵","id":"主要贸易国木质包装检疫法规与准入差异矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标记体系：IPPC 钢印的字段语义","id":"标记体系-ippc-钢印的字段语义"},{"level":2,"text":"主要贸易国准入差异矩阵","id":"主要贸易国准入差异矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"各国差异的制度根源","id":"各国差异的制度根源"},{"level":2,"text":"把差异编码进合规系统","id":"把差异编码进合规系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ISPM-15 国际标准与植物检疫制度框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/phytosanitary-regime-legal-model/ispm15-standard-phytosanitary-framework"},"next":{"title":"违规责任归属、处罚后果与合规义务分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ispm15-wood-packaging-phytosanitary-customs-compliance/phytosanitary-regime-legal-model/violation-liability-compliance-obligation"}}